    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15351" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ējectĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				casting</i> or <i>throwing out</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguinis,</span>”
				<i>a spitting of blood</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					1, 6, 3</span></i>
			: mortem et ejectionem timemus, i. e. <i>banishment</i>, <i>exile</i>, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				2, 18, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Thren. 2,
			14</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">articuli,</span>”
				i. e. <i>dislocation</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 2, 1, 28</span></i>
			.</div>
